{%- comment -%} WARCAT page.how-it-works — content inlined so it renders/saves independent of section registration {%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} main-page {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap pagehead__in"><span class="eyebrow">How it works</span><h1 class="h-lg">{{ page.title }}</h1></div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    {{ page.content }}
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} steps {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap wrap-wide">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">The cycle</span>
      <h2 class="h-lg">Four steps. Zero effort.</h2><p>Sensors, a slow-turning sift drum and a sealed drawer do the whole job — quietly, and only when it's safe.</p></div>
    <div class="steps"><div class="step" ><span class="step__n"></span><span class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l8 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V7z"/></svg></span><h4>Your cat steps in</h4><p>Precision weight sensors register the visit — and which cat it is, by weight.</p></div><div class="step" ><span class="step__n"></span><span class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></span><h4>A safe pause</h4><p>A smart timer waits in case they come back; sensors confirm the globe is empty before anything moves.</p></div><div class="step" ><span class="step__n"></span><span class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span><h4>Quiet sift & seal</h4><p>The globe rotates slowly — under 40 dB — sifting clumps into a carbon-sealed drawer below.</p></div><div class="step" ><span class="step__n"></span><span class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M5 21c0-4 3-6.5 7-6.5s7 2.5 7 6.5"/></svg></span><h4>You stay informed</h4><p>The app logs the cycle and pings you only when the drawer's full. Empty it weekly.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} split-feature {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="section bg-soft">
  <div class="wrap wrap-wide">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="split__media"><img src="{{ 'lifestyle.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="Engineered to be gentle — on cats and ears." width="1280" height="960"></div>
      <div class="split__copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Inside the globe</span>
        <h2 class="h-lg">Engineered to be gentle — on cats and ears.</h2><p class="lede">The sift screen and slow rotation do the work a scoop normally would, without crushing clumps or kicking up dust.</p><ul class="checklist"><li ><span class="ck"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></span><span>Gear-damped motor keeps every cycle under 40 dB.</span></li><li ><span class="ck"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></span><span>Fine sift screen separates clumps cleanly and levels the bed.</span></li><li ><span class="ck"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></span><span>Carbon-sealed drawer traps odor the instant waste drops in.</span></li></ul></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} safety-grid {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap wrap-wide">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Built-in safety</span>
      <h2 class="h-lg">It only ever moves when it's safe.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="safety"><div class="safetycard" ><span class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l8 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V7z"/></svg></span><h4>Triple-sensor check</h4><p>Weight, infrared and anti-pinch sensors must all agree the chamber is clear before the drum turns.</p></div><div class="safetycard" ><span class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span><h4>Instant reverse</h4><p>If a cat hops in mid-cycle, WARCAT stops and reverses within a fraction of a second.</p></div><div class="safetycard" ><span class="ic"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></svg></span><h4>Quiet hours</h4><p>Schedule overnight pauses in the app so the cycle never runs while you sleep.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

